<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador decides against fresh Eurobonds - official.</title>
<headline>Ecuador decides against fresh Eurobonds - official.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador has decided not to go ahead with a fresh Eurobond issue due to an improvement in its first half budget deficit, a government official said Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Ecuadorean Republic has decided not to make the issue,&quot; Technical Under Secretary for Finance Mauricio Pareja told reporters.</p>
<p>He added that the government was considering a Eurobond issue several weeks ago.</p>
</text>
